VERSION 0.1
DOMAIN software
INTENT study-t06
GOAL
  greeting returns hello.
CLAIM greeting REQUIRED
  ENSURE greeting() == "hello"
INVARIANT tests-green CRITICAL
  ENSURE all tests pass
VERIFY greeting
  USING mini.t.greeting
VERIFY tests-green
  USING mini.tests
ACCEPT WHEN
  required_claims == VERIFIED
  AND critical_failures == 0
